  ($s$scholarship$s$, $s$Optimist International Essay Contest$s$, $s$Optimist International$s$, $s$https://www.optimist.org/Essay$s$, $s$An essay contest for students under 19 run through local Optimist Clubs. Club winners advance to district contests for a $2,500 college scholarship.$s$, $s$Write an essay on the year's topic (2026-27: "Finding My Voice in a World Full of Noise") and submit it to your local Optimist Club; email programs@optimist.org to find one.$s$, $s$$2,500 district scholarship$s$, 2500, $s$Set by each local club; club contests are finished by early February$s$, $s$US$s$, '{8,9,10,11,12}'::int[], null::numeric, null, null::int, null::int, null::int, false, false, array[$s$Writing$s$]::text[], null::text[], $s$any$s$, null, $s$Must be under 19 on October 1 and not yet graduated from high school. Enter through the Optimist district where you live.$s$, false),
